 "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "daily = frec != diario OR dia == afuera; toric if astig == si; silicone hydrogel tag if office/mix screens. Two cards: first option and alternative (swapped replacement). Notes: expired/missing prescription -> schedule a check-up; unsure astigmatism -> check CYL and axis."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_product_card", "label": "Product recommendation card ([Producto J&J], tags, why, [PRECIO], 'Ver en la tienda')", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L273-L291", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_receta_section", "label": "Receta 'Opti te orienta. Tu especialista te receta.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L317-L345", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Safety disclaimer: Opti never calculates or suggests a prescription; expired prescription -> suggests a check-up; symptoms (red eye, pain, blurred vision) -> refer to a professional."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_store_cta_section", "label": "Store CTA '\u00bfYa sabes cu\u00e1les quieres?' (oo-cierre)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L347-L357", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_u_ribbon", "label": "U ribbon with 'TODO PARA VER BIEN' text; offset tied to closing section progress (ribbonOff = -420 + pC*420)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L348, L487-L492, L671", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_pattern_strip", "label": "Pattern strip before footer (pa